WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.403
JAMIE: Which is an interesting legal
theory, because that sentence reads to
me

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:06.806
JAMIE: like the opposite of
coordination. It reads like people
saying: we can't

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:10.209
JAMIE: stop because no one else will.

00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:13.526
RUFUS: That is exactly the tension. The
same phrase can be read as

00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:16.733
RUFUS: evidence of a prisoner's dilemma
— or as evidence of a cartel.

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:19.940
RUFUS: The lawyers are arguing cartel.

00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:22.109
ALEX: What did OpenAI actually say in
response?
